# Howlsquad Heavy (max speed - "{T}: Add {R} for each Goblin you control"): counted as it resolves, the Heavy alone is one Goblin, and Bot2's Goblin Assailant does not
# count. Kickoff Celebrations gives Bot1 speed 1 on turn 1 and Lightning Bolts to Bot2's face raise it on turns 3, 5 and 7 (2, 3, 4). The Heavy comes down after turn 5's
# combat, so it has made no token yet. On turn 7 its combat trigger makes a Goblin token that must attack and Bot2's Assailant blocks and kills it; in the second
# main phase the Heavy is the only Goblin Bot1 controls and taps for exactly {R}.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Kickoff Celebrations
Howlsquad Heavy
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Goblin Assailant
Island x20

